sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as Vue.js Frontend
    participant API as .NET API<br/>(Carter + MediatR)
    participant ML as Python ML Service<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>+ pgvector
    
    User->>Frontend: Upload search image
    activate Frontend
    Frontend->>Frontend: Validate image<br/>(size, format)
    
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/search/visual<br/>{image: base64}
    activate API
    
    API->>API: Validate request
    API->>ML: gRPC: GenerateEmbedding(image)
    activate ML
    
    ML->>ML: Load Fashion-CLIP<br/>(lazy loading)
    ML->>ML: Preprocess image<br/>(resize 224×224, normalize)
    ML->>ML: Forward pass through<br/>ViT-B/16 encoder
    ML->>ML: Extract 512-dim vector
    
    ML-->>API: EmbeddingResult<br/>{vector: float[], time: 67.7ms}
    deactivate ML
    
    API->>DB: SELECT id, name, price, image_url<br/>FROM products p<br/>JOIN image_embeddings e<br/>ON p.id = e.product_id<br/>WHERE e.model = 'fashion-clip'<br/>ORDER BY e.vector <=> $1<br/>LIMIT 10
    activate DB
    
    DB->>DB: HNSW index search<br/>(m=16, ef_search=40)
    DB->>DB: Calculate cosine distances
    
    DB-->>API: Top 10 products<br/>{id, name, price, similarity}
    deactivate DB
    
    API->>API: Map to DTOs
    API-->>Frontend: SearchResults<br/>{products: [], totalTime: 280ms}
    deactivate API
    
    Frontend->>Frontend: Render product grid
    Frontend-->>User: Display 10 similar products
    deactivate Frontend
    
    Note over User,DB: Total latency: ~280ms<br/>Embedding: 67.7ms | DB Query: <10ms | Network: ~200ms
